                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "738a541c-dc75-3610-adf0-0eb0a8cc0913",
                        "entry_id": "36decaf9-ec1e-31c9-b496-f8df07e6d2f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a soft, sheer fabric"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "inanimate",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cb7cab7-0519-4e95-8de5-9b0f9c3b6d22",
                                "sense_id": "738a541c-dc75-3610-adf0-0eb0a8cc0913",
                                "text": "И, флёр от шля́пы отверну́в,\nГлаза́ми бе́глыми чита́ет\nПросту́ю на́дпись — и слеза́\nТума́нит не́жные глаза́.",
                                "translation": "She lifts her veil of gauze and reads\nThe plain inscription quickly, causing\nA tear to dim her tender eyes\nAt Lensky’s premature demise.",
                                "english": "She lifts her veil of gauze and reads\nThe plain inscription quickly, causing\nA tear to dim her tender eyes\nAt Lensky’s premature demise."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75abef6e-1e7e-3de6-8359-02e5910cb532",
                        "entry_id": "36decaf9-ec1e-31c9-b496-f8df07e6d2f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "illusion"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "inanimate",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2164ff4a-5dfc-4608-adca-0fb94a244624",
                                "sense_id": "75abef6e-1e7e-3de6-8359-02e5910cb532",
                                "text": "Гру́стно ви́деть, когда́ ю́ноша теря́ет лу́чшие свои́ наде́жды и мечты́, когда́ пред ним отдёргивается ро́зовый флёр, сквозь кото́рый он смотре́л на дела́ и чу́вства челове́ческие, хотя́ есть наде́жда, что он заме́нит ста́рые заблужде́ния но́выми, не ме́нее проходя́щими, но зато́ не ме́нее сла́дкими…",
                                "translation": "It is sad to see a young man's finest hopes and dreams shattered, to see him lose the rosy illusions with which he viewed man's deeds and emotions, although there is still hope that he may exchange the old delusions for new ones no less transitory but also no less sweet.",
                                "english": "It is sad to see a young man's finest hopes and dreams shattered, to see him lose the rosy illusions with which he viewed man's deeds and emotions, although there is still hope that he may exchange the old delusions for new ones no less transitory but also no less sweet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
